  (text "Logic supply OR-ing (D-046): logic runs from the battery or from USB alone"
    (at 145.4 33.48 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "d072b0d2-1f09-5522-9980-5bd1f02af510"))
  (text "VLOGIC = max(VBAT, VBUS) - Vf. With USB only (no battery) the board can be powered on and flashed."
    (at 145.4 36.68 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "feac7db1-5cb5-5754-b617-03be0eae762d"))
  (text "VLOGIC peak load ~4.9 W -> ~0.9 A at 5.5 V, ~1.1 A from USB alone: SS34 (3 A, SMA) instead of SOD-323 parts."
    (at 145.4 39.88 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "336b5cda-d2af-539c-bfb0-ad6d50016e3d"))
  (text "On USB alone firmware must cap the load (Wi-Fi TX power, camera, LEDs) to stay near 500 mA (DR-09)."
    (at 145.4 43.08 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fbd71122-b1d5-5ceb-a749-eaeeb3fb07e9"))
  (text "R20 bleeds VBUS so D2 reverse leakage cannot fake 'USB present' when only the battery is plugged in."
    (at 145.4 46.28 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ada480ec-a185-54d2-8607-db8b69339a1c"))
