  (text "Hardware battery undervoltage cut-off - TLV6700 (R-13, D-053, D-055) - last resort"
    (at 15.24 180.28 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8f13fb7e-8c9f-5fb1-b694-bb1de0f9394e"))
  (text "behind the firmware"
    (at 15.24 183.48 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e155a7d8-3ee9-5673-ba24-3763c56d5609"))
  (text "Trip: V = 0.3945 V x (1.5 M + 110 k) / 110 k = 5.77 V (2.89 V/cell); release 0.400 x 14.64 = 5.85 V."
    (at 15.24 186.68 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b8964509-e0f4-5686-8665-e34371f6bc10"))
  (text "C24 filters load sag: tau = (1.5 M || 110 k) x 4.7 uF = 0.48 s, so throttle punches do not cut power."
    (at 15.24 189.88 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "079891a5-933a-5286-9f21-e1fec0ce822f"))
  (text "Q5 disconnects the cut-off while USB is present (VBUS_DET low): TLV6700 holds OUTA low below its UVLO and"
    (at 15.24 193.08 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f167a517-319e-546a-9232-e419cd586ad1"))
  (text "VBAT is not 0 V without a battery (charger battery detection, D3 leakage), which would block USB-only power-on."
    (at 15.24 196.28 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4928e9a5-fbed-55ab-9332-39cd17e1806d"))
  (text "Firmware lands first at 3.4 V/cell under load."
    (at 15.24 199.48 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a52bbc88-858a-54cf-95ee-780d02ad2496"))
