  (text "ESC gate-driver supply: TPS22810 switch (D-036) + MT3608 boost to 9.6 V (D-054), and the"
    (at 398.887 180.28 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bbc5fdd2-01a1-5c0e-a73e-698902c71573"))
  (text "ESC board link"
    (at 398.887 183.48 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "21524722-f1ea-5cfe-b4a1-72597d8562db"))
  (text "VDRV = 9.6 V for the 4x FD6288Q drivers and the ESC board's own 3.3 V regulator (D-048). A boost keeps the"
    (at 398.887 186.68 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e2ab6f68-96f0-550b-8602-4385ba554348"))
  (text "drivers well above their 5.0 V UVLO when a 2S pack sags under load, and gives 10 V-class gate drive."
    (at 398.887 189.88 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6d73935b-a454-53cb-92db-550235e047c9"))
  (text "VOUT = 0.6 V x (1 + 150 k / 10 k) = 9.6 V. D = 1 - Vin/Vout = 0.08-0.38. Load ~50 mA (ESC 3.3 V + drivers)."
    (at 398.887 193.08 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "3ac38cec-d908-5c6b-95a2-7f86ea737601"))
  (text "Ripple dI = 6 V x 0.38 / (10 uH x 1.2 MHz) = 0.19 A p-p, far below the 4 A switch limit."
    (at 398.887 196.28 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7d211d1b-f787-537c-9782-e7205f676d08"))
  (text "QOD on VOUT discharges VDRV_SW when off; the boost then passes 0 V. CT 3.3 nF: ~0.7 ms rise."
    (at 398.887 199.48 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "250ebf78-94a3-570e-be61-2e912c58dd47"))
